{"id":"162ba4b092f14c5b","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-supportset.md","title":"Support sets for unrestricted partial-function extensions","display":"df-supportset — Support sets for unrestricted partial-function extensions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-supportset","aliases":["27-df-supportset"],"display":"df-supportset — Support sets for unrestricted partial-function extensions","depends_on":["[[27-df-pdbf]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§12.2.2 Support sets of variables","source_printed_pages":"515–516","source_pdf_pages":"539–540","verification_status":"source-statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-supportset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-supportset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-supportset — Support sets for unrestricted partial-function extensions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ea846f0a3813bc0e\" href=\"?note=ea846f0a3813bc0e\" title=\"27-df-pdbf\">27-df-pdbf</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§12.2.2 Support sets of variables"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"515–516"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"539–540"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\">\\(T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq[n]\">\\(S\\subseteq[n]\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pdBf}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{pdBf}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ea846f0a3813bc0e\" href=\"?note=ea846f0a3813bc0e\" title=\"27-df-pdbf\">27-df-pdbf</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a|_S\">\\(a|_S\\)</span> 为集合论函数限制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"U|_S\\coloneqq\\{a|_S\\mid a\\in U\\}\\quad(U\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[U|_S\\coloneqq\\{a|_S\\mid a\\in U\\}\\quad(U\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Support}(T,F)\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq[n]\\mid(T|_S)\\cap(F|_S)=\\emptyset\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Support}(T,F)\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq[n]\\mid(T|_S)\\cap(F|_S)=\\emptyset\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MinSupport}(T,F)\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathrm{Support}(T,F)\\mid\\forall R\\subsetneq S\\;(R\\notin\\mathrm{Support}(T,F))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MinSupport}(T,F)\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathrm{Support}(T,F)\\mid\\forall R\\subsetneq S\\;(R\\notin\\mathrm{Support}(T,F))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OptSupport}(T,F)\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathrm{Support}(T,F)\\mid\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Support}(T,F)\\;(|S|\\leq|R|)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{OptSupport}(T,F)\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathrm{Support}(T,F)\\mid\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Support}(T,F)\\;(|S|\\leq|R|)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里选 class ALL，不把 support 与 Boolean point 的 supp 混淆。最小（按包含）与最少（按基数）分别建模，投影后矛盾恰表示该变量集不足以区分样本。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-pdbf","status":"resolved","id":"ea846f0a3813bc0e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-pdbf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-pdbf","status":"resolved","id":"ea846f0a3813bc0e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$，$S\\subseteq[n]$；$\\mathrm{pdBf}_n$ 见 [[27-df-pdbf]]。$a|_S$ 为集合论函数限制。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq[n]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{pdBf}_n","display":false},{"tex":"a|_S","display":false},{"tex":"U|_S\\coloneqq\\{a|_S\\mid a\\in U\\}\\quad(U\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Support}(T,F)\\coloneqq\\{S\\subseteq[n]\\mid(T|_S)\\cap(F|_S)=\\emptyset\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MinSupport}(T,F)\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathrm{Support}(T,F)\\mid\\forall R\\subsetneq S\\;(R\\notin\\mathrm{Support}(T,F))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OptSupport}(T,F)\\coloneqq\\{S\\in\\mathrm{Support}(T,F)\\mid\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Support}(T,F)\\;(|S|\\leq|R|)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1512,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-348","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-supportset|df-supportset — Support sets for unrestricted partial-function extensions]]"},{"id":"1105d909ac8fadce","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$(T,F)\\in\\mathrm{pdBf}_n$，$S\\subseteq[n]$，$y\\in\\mathbb B^n$；$\\mathrm{Support},\\mathrm{OptSupport}$ 见 [[27-df-supportset]]。"},{"id":"fd4ded42af655de9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}$，$T,F\\subseteq\\mathbb B^n$，$S\\subseteq[n]$；$\\mathrm{Support}(T,F)$ 见 [[27-df-supportset]]，$\\mathrm{Ext}_n$ 见 [[27-df-extension]]。$\\mathbb B^S$ 为S上的布尔赋值集，$\\pi_S$ 由下式构造。"}],"outgoing":["ea846f0a3813bc0e"]}